{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1790691060, "covers_from": "2026-09-29T14:11:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-09-29T14:12:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1790691120, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-09-29T14:11:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "queue_number": 53507, "sprite_key": "squirrel_business", "district": "nangang", "topic": "交通", "content": "我每天上班開車途經南港路、園區街，很驚訝台北市的馬路這麼坑坑疤疤，我彰化老家鄉間馬路都鋪得比台北好", "display_name": "南港代表 No.53,507", "mood": "helpless", "is_replay": false}, {"starts_at": "2026-09-29T14:11:15+00:00", "duration_seconds": 14, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 39511, "sprite_key": "deer_suburb", "district": "beitou", "topic": "觀光", "content": "台北的飯店真的太貴了，明明沒有什麼厲害的設施，但都還要比國外一線城市還要貴，這要怎麼來處理", "display_name": "北投代表 No.39,511", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-09-29T14:11:29+00:00", "duration_seconds": 14, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 50261, "sprite_key": "squirrel_culture", "district": "zhongshan", "topic": "交通", "content": "希望台北市可以有更多機車停車格，因為大部分的停車場站都是汽車專用，不知道有沒有辦法改善", "display_name": "中山代表 No.50,261", "mood": "hopeful", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-09-29T14:11:43+00:00", "duration_seconds": 8, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 25945, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_business", "district": "xinyi", "topic": "環境", "content": "房價太貴了，租金太貴了，北漂族買不起，租的很辛苦", "display_name": "信義代表 No.25,945", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-09-29T14:11:51+00:00", "duration_seconds": 9, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 28924, "sprite_key": "elephant_business", "district": "neihu", "topic": "市政", "content": "希望我們城市能超過高雄，好想要很多藝人活動♡", "display_name": "內湖代表 No.28,924", "mood": "positive", "is_replay": true}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_number": 39511, "sprite_key": "deer_suburb", "display_name": "北投代表 No.39,511", "district": "beitou", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 2, "queue_number": 50261, "sprite_key": "squirrel_culture", "display_name": "中山代表 No.50,261", "district": "zhongshan", "is_replay": tru